        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: C. S. Lewis, Clive Staples Lewis\n- Works: Surprised by Joy: The Shape of My Early Life\n- Topics: autobiography, literary biography\n\nFacts:\n- Clive Staples Lewis was born on 29 November 1898 and died on 22 November 1963.\n- C. S. Lewis was a British novelist, poet, academic, medievalist, literary critic, essayist, lay theologian, broadcaster, lecturer, and Christian apologist.\n- In 1955, C. S. Lewis published Surprised by Joy: The Shape of My Early Life.\n- Surprised by Joy: The Shape of My Early Life is a partial autobiography by C. S. Lewis.",
